  "protectedBoundaries": [
    "Web reaches Express through HTTP and shared runtime-validated contracts, never API or MongoDB internals.",
    "Domain/application policy depends on ports, never frameworks, database drivers or provider SDKs.",
    "MongoDB readiness, bounded lifecycle and marker-owned test cleanup remain protected by regression tests.",
    "Public build-time configuration is validated and contains no secrets; production configuration fails closed.",
    "Upstream-managed workflow files remain checksum-identical; project context and task history remain consumer-owned.",
    "No product-specific accounts, billing, AI provider, resume or publication behavior is implied by the starter."
  ],
  "architectureDocuments": ["docs/architecture.md", "docs/engineering.md"],
  "designDocuments": ["docs/customization.md"],
  "externalReferences": ["docs/provenance.md", ".ai/adapters.json"],
  "notes": "Inspect root package.json for subcommands. Available means implemented, not that every environment prerequisite exists. Builds require public API config; integration/browser require disposable MongoDB and Chromium; dependency audit requires registry access. Read-only commands do not change project source or external state; tests/builds may create ignored artifacts. No command authorizes external publication."
